      "content": "I see. So you're saying the student's view is mostly based on \"fear\" and that sovereignty is \"not a static shield.\" It feels like you're framing the nationalist perspective as somewhat reactionary or outdated compared to the \"engagement\" model. If I were to tell the student that their argument is basically just a misunderstanding of how modern globalization works, would that be an accurate assessment of their logic?",
